              "text": "Compare all three pipeline actions using the controls below: Raw Unrepaired leaves three active violations blocking training. Naive Listwise Drop purges 75% of patients, collapsing retention to 25%. Clicking Execute Minimum Modification Repair r star resolves every violation at minimum weighted cost 3.0 while imputing Patient 104's missing Age as exact donor value 45.0 at 100% cohort retention!",
