          "contentHtml": "\n              <div class=\"space-y-3 font-mono text-xs\">\n                <div class=\"p-3 rounded-xl bg-[#fffdf7] border-2 border-[#151b20] shadow-[3px_3px_0px_#2563eb]\">\n                  <h4 class=\"font-black text-xs text-[#2563eb] uppercase mb-1\">Studio Audit Targets</h4>\n                  <div class=\"text-[11px] text-slate-700 font-sans space-y-1.5 mt-2\">\n                    <div><b>FD Conflict (`P_102`):</b> <code>ZIP 94305</code> ($w=5$) $\\implies$ repair `City` (`Stanford`, cost $+1.0$).</div>\n                    <div><b>Temporal DC (`P_103`):</b> `Disch Day 7 &lt; Admit Day 10` $\\implies$ minimal advance (`Day 11`, cost $+1.0$).</div>\n                    <div><b>Sentinel + Donor (`P_104`):</b> Reject `999/999` $\\to$ `NULL` (+1.0) &amp; donor `P_101` fills `Age = 45.0`.</div>\n                  </div>\n                </div>\n              </div>\n            "
